Cell["\<\
It is obvious that all three curves are isomorphic because they all have the \
same j-invariant and group structure.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9997491460011377`*^9, 3.999749257498176*^9}, {
  3.9997494420118313`*^9, 3.999749442531951*^9}, {4.002604280917148*^9, 
