  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["x", "3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ab759c54-401b-4d32-a69b-611b48bf5c3f"],
 " + 73.\n(a) Compute P + Q and (P + Q) + R.\n(b) Compute Q + R and P + (Q + \
R). Your answer for P + (Q + R) should agree with the result of part (a)."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.999753938356552*^9, 3.999753960133643*^9}, 
